REGULAR AND ANNUAL ME[ETING] Section 4[.]02 Regular[ meetings shall] be held on the second Thursday of every[ month] at 7:00 p.[m]., unless such[ day falls] on a legal holiday, in which event the regular[ meeting] for that month[ shall] be held at the same hour and place on the next available day[.
