=== Text #1 ===
> [The] iconic bullpup-style Steyr[ A]UG has[ been] one of the most recognizable rifles in the world since[ its adoption] by the Austrian[ army in 1977]. Now available for civilian use as the Steyr[ A]UG[ A3 M]1, it is a semi-automatic amb[ide]xtrous rifle platform with adjustable[ short]-stroke gas-piston operation chambered[ in 5.]56[x]45mm[ (.]223 Remington).
